"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🦀 Fishing on warm summer days </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line, <strong>catch fish</strong>, and pull up crabs to add to your collection. Every catch feels like a little win, especially when something rare surprises you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/2172b524581f5dccd3c69e3d834be5b2.poster.avif?t=1785054216\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/2172b524581f5dccd3c69e3d834be5b2.webm?t=1785054216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/2172b524581f5dccd3c69e3d834be5b2.mp4?t=1785054216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎴 Marubi is the island’s latest obsession</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs, meet new marble monsters and build a team you love. Challenge the locals and watch your <strong>Marubï</strong> slam into the arena with a satisfying clack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/509ca56ceb79be5bcb273ed93b6367e5.poster.avif?t=1785054216\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/509ca56ceb79be5bcb273ed93b6367e5.webm?t=1785054216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/509ca56ceb79be5bcb273ed93b6367e5.mp4?t=1785054216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>👨‍👩‍👦 Meet the locals of Kioku</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the locals, help them out, and earn your place in the community. The more you connect, the more the island opens up - new stories, new places, new little routines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/fa62de73af8ada3ebf09e02ec6c9dc51.poster.avif?t=1785054216\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/fa62de73af8ada3ebf09e02ec6c9dc51.webm?t=1785054216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/fa62de73af8ada3ebf09e02ec6c9dc51.mp4?t=1785054216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚲 Wander freely across Kioku Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kioku is a cozy island made for wandering, with secrets tucked into every path and corner. Drift from town streets and the pier to forest trails, the mountain, and places that feel a little mysterious. If you follow your curiosity, you’ll always find something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/72b25fb4f21609a6818bd8a7790a9c70.poster.avif?t=1785054216\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/72b25fb4f21609a6818bd8a7790a9c70.webm?t=1785054216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/72b25fb4f21609a6818bd8a7790a9c70.mp4?t=1785054216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><stron